{"id":"tampouco","lemma":"tampouco","pos":"adv","rank":3616,"glosses":["neither"],"ipa":"/tɐ̃ˈpo(w).ku/","examples":[{"text":"Eu tampouco gosto disso.","en":"I don't like it, either.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"taste"},null]},{"text":"Tom não quer isso tampouco.","en":"Tom doesn't want this either.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"Não sou capaz de ler em francês, tampouco falar tal língua.","en":"I can't read French, nor can I speak it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/485171","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"am","l":"ser"},{"g":"no way!"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to read"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"French"},null,{"g":"to speak"},{"g":"such-and-such"},{"g":"tongue"}]},{"text":"Não gostamos dos nossos vizinhos e tampouco eles gostam de nós.","en":"We don't like our neighbors, and they don't like us, either.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to like","l":"gostar"},null,{"g":"our kin"},{"g":"neighbouring","l":"vizinho"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"they"},{"g":"to like","l":"gostar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"we"}]},{"text":"Minha mulher não compareceu à festa, tampouco fi-lo eu.","en":"My wife did not attend the party and neither did I.","words":[{"g":"my, mine","l":"meu"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"[with a] to attend","l":"comparecer"},{"g":"forms adverbs meaning…"},{"g":"party"},null,null,null,{"g":"I"}]}]}